        <div style="font-size:10.5pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;text-transform:uppercase;">DIGITAL LITERACY COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT SERVICE GROUP</div>
      </td>
      <td style="width:12%;border:none;text-align:right;vertical-align:middle;">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100px;height:auto;" alt="DL4ALL Logo">
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- Metadata -->
  <table style="width:100%;border:none;margin-bottom:6pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:9.5pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;">STATE: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 12pt;">CROSS RIVER</span></td>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;text-align:center;">ZONE: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 15pt;">OGOJA</span></td>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;text-align:center;">QUARTER: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 15pt;">3RD</span></td>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;text-align:right;">YEAR: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 15pt;">2026</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- Table -->
  <table class="report-table" style="width:100%;border:1.0pt solid windowtext;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="background:#f2f2f2;font-weight:bold;font-size:8.8pt;text-align:center;">
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 3pt;width:4.5%;">S/N</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:11.5%;">NAME OF GROUP</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 3pt;width:6.5%;">NUMBER<br>OF C/MS</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:12.5%;">LOCATION</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 3pt;width:7%;">LGA</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;width:33.5%;">NATURE OF ACTIVITIES</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:14%;">ACHIEVEMENTS</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:10.5%;">REMARKS</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr style="mso-yfti-irow:1;page-break-inside:avoid;">
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">1.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Digital Literacy CDS Group</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">8</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">St. Joseph's Vicinity, Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 6pt;text-align:justify;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;"><b>YOUTH & STUDENT DIGITAL SKILLS OUTREACH:</b> DLC members carried out targeted digital literacy sensitization for youth and secondary school students within the St. Joseph's community in Obudu. The session focused on empowering young learners with smartphone literacy for educational advancement. DLCs conducted one-on-one practical coaching on utilizing mobile devices for e-learning, accessing academic research materials, leveraging search engines, and using safe communication tools.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Over 25 youths and students received practical hands-on guidance on using smartphones for educational research and collaborative study. Beneficiaries learned safe internet practices and academic discovery techniques.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Highly engaging and well-received by community youths who expressed keen interest in leveraging digital tools for their school studies.</td>
      </tr>      <tr style="mso-yfti-irow:1;page-break-inside:avoid;">
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">2.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Digital Literacy CDS Group</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">10</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu Urban Dev. Authority (OUDA), Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 6pt;text-align:justify;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;"><b>INSTITUTIONAL ADVOCACY & WORKPLACE CAMPAIGN:</b> DLC members conducted an official advocacy and awareness visit to the Obudu Urban Development Authority (OUDA). The corps members engaged public sector workers and agency staff on the national 'DL4ALL: Not Just the Number but the Impact' initiative. The sensitization covered workplace digital tools, electronic document workflow, cloud storage fundamentals, and critical cybersecurity hygiene to prevent official data leaks and phishing attacks.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Sensitized agency staff and civil servants on digital productivity tools and office workflow efficiency. Established collaboration with agency leadership to support community-wide digital literacy initiatives.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Successful institutional engagement; agency leadership commended the NYSC DLC initiative for promoting digital readiness in the public sector.</td>
      </tr>      <tr style="mso-yfti-irow:1;page-break-inside:avoid;">
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">3.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Digital Literacy CDS Group</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">12</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu Main Market, Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 6pt;text-align:justify;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;"><b>MARKET TRADERS DIGITAL INCLUSION OUTREACH:</b> Under the campaign banner 'Enabling Every Nigerian Citizen to Embrace Technology with Confidence,' DLC members conducted an extensive field outreach at Obudu Main Market. Deployed in peer teams, DLCs engaged traders, artisans, and transport operators directly in their shops and stalls. Members conducted practical demonstrations on mobile banking apps, USSD transactions, point-of-sale security, fraud prevention, and introduced traders to the free NITDA digital skills curriculum platform (dl4all.nitda.gov.ng).</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Over 35 market stalls and small business owners were trained on mobile financial transactions, secure digital payments, and avoiding mobile scams. Several traders successfully navigated digital customer communication tools on their devices.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Very impactful field sensitization. Traders welcomed the practical business applications of digital tools; follow-up sessions were requested.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- Signatures -->
